This product includes Kotlin ports of parts of D3 (https://d3js.org), by Mike Bostock,
under the ISC License:

  - d3-array: tick generation (ticks, tickIncrement, tickStep), in charts-core Scales.kt
  - d3-scale: scaleLinear, scaleBand and scalePoint equivalents, and scaleTime().ticks()
    calendar intervals, in charts-core Scales.kt and TimeTicks.kt
  - d3-time-format: the multi-scale tick format (each label shows the coarsest field that
    changed), in charts-core TimeTicks.kt
  - d3-shape: curveLinear, curveMonotoneX (Fritsch-Carlson) and curveStep, line.defined()
    gaps, and stack() with stackOffsetDiverging, in charts-core Curves.kt and Stack.kt
  - d3-hierarchy: treemapSquarify (Bruls, Huizing and van Wijk), in charts-core Treemap.kt
  - d3-scale-chromatic: the first six colours of schemeCategory10, in charts-compose
    ChartStyle.kt (Category10)

