The architecture (a renderer-neutral core that compiles chart definitions into a keyed
scene graph, marks, nearest-point focus and keyed reconciliation, painted by a thin
renderer) follows TanStack Charts (https://github.com/TanStack/charts). No TanStack
source is included; the design is credited under its MIT License:

